WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:02.810
My name is Taiki Kudou.

00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:06.480
I was taken to this place 
called the Digital World,

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:09.490
where I met Shoutmon and 
lots of other Digimon.

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:13.110
This world is having a lot of trouble

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:15.330
<b>Team Bagra</b>

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:15.330
<b>Team Twilight      Xros Heart (Team Taiki)   Team Blue Flare</b>

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:15.330
Protagonist                                                                  Rival

00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:15.330
with the attacking Bagra Army.

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:19.920
While in the Forest Zone, 
we learned Nene's secret.

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:23.940
Following Nene, who disappeared 
with DarkKnightmon,

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:26.200
we set off for the Dust Zone, but...

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:29.950
Taiki!

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:43.190
<b>Dust Zone, GrandLocomon's</b>

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:43.190
<b>Great Scrap City!</b>

00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:42.240
Dust Zone, GrandLocomon's 
Great Scrap City!

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:52.860
Where am I?

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:57.640
Welcome, Taiki Kudou.

00:00:57.640 --> 00:00:59.320
DarkKnightmon!

00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:01.730
You brought me here?

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:05.380
My Xros Loader is gone!

00:01:05.380 --> 00:01:09.720
Yes. You are the other 
boy Nene had her eye on.

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:11.620
Where is Nene?!

00:01:14.270 --> 00:01:16.520
Nene is in there.

00:01:16.520 --> 00:01:18.420
Try and save her.

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:21.290
Nene's in here?

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:24.500
Yes, she is in there.

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:25.330
Nene?

00:01:30.170 --> 00:01:33.960
I thought perhaps the dark 
power was within you, too.

00:01:35.390 --> 00:01:36.900
What are you talking about?

00:01:48.370 --> 00:01:50.320
I don't want your help...

00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:52.660
Darn it...

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:02.970
What is this? 
Did we fall in a garbage heap?

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:04.470
This sucks.

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:08.110
Hey, where did Taiki go, anyway?

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:11.600
Taiki?!

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:14.750
Go, cushion!

00:02:19.070 --> 00:02:21.490
Y-You okay, Taiki?

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:22.890
Thanks...

00:02:24.830 --> 00:02:26.380
Thank goodness!

00:02:26.380 --> 00:02:28.890
Wait, where did you fall from?

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:31.210
From the top of that tower.

00:02:32.990 --> 00:02:35.460
DarkKnightmon is in there.

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:37.190
DarkKnightmon?

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:39.470
So he tricked us.

00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:40.400
Yeah...

00:02:40.400 --> 00:02:41.170
Who's there?!

00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:45.380
Welcome to the Dust Zone.

00:02:45.740 --> 00:02:48.250
If you get it now, 
hand over your fancy mecha.

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:50.250
Cough up all your fancy mecha!

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:52.420
Fancy mecha?

00:02:52.420 --> 00:02:54.390
Quit messing around!

00:02:54.850 --> 00:02:57.420
You're the ones messing around!

00:02:59.620 --> 00:03:02.860
Taiki, there are too many of them! 
We have to DigiXros!

00:03:02.860 --> 00:03:05.130
We can't! My Xros Loader is...

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:07.780
You mean this?

00:03:07.780 --> 00:03:08.900
Catch!

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:10.750
Way to go, Zenjirou!

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:13.270
Garbagemon!

00:03:13.270 --> 00:03:16.700
Oh! I got a fancy mecha!

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:19.690
Hey! Give that back!

00:03:25.420 --> 00:03:27.620
So long!

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:29.460
They're fast!

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:30.360
Taiki, get on!

00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:31.220
Okay!

00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:32.490
I'm going, too!

00:03:32.490 --> 00:03:33.860
Shoutmon!

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:34.890
Here we go!

00:03:42.730 --> 00:03:43.480
What's that?

00:03:43.480 --> 00:03:44.700
A locomotive?

00:03:47.170 --> 00:03:49.610
Quickly, get on!

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:54.610
Full speed ahead!

00:03:57.850 --> 00:03:59.980
Dorulumon, can you catch them?

00:03:59.980 --> 00:04:01.490
There's no question about it.

00:04:01.490 --> 00:04:03.050
I <i>will</i> catch them!

00:04:06.460 --> 00:04:08.200
They're still chasing us.

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:10.090
They don't know when to give up.

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:12.600
Leave it to me!

00:04:16.550 --> 00:04:18.430
Serves you right!

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:21.550
Are you okay, Taiki?

00:04:21.550 --> 00:04:23.410
I'll take it from here.

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:29.170
Outta the way!

00:04:29.170 --> 00:04:31.750
Trying to carry scrap here!

00:04:33.140 --> 00:04:36.060
What kind of Zone is this?

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:41.420
This is the kind of Zone where 
the ones who have things stolen

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:43.010
are worse than the ones who steal.

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:43.760
Who's there?

00:04:44.210 --> 00:04:46.200
Nobody around here but thieves 
whose bodies and souls alike

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:48.700
are no better than garbage.

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:51.130
You can't trust anybody here.

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:54.270
If you get it, then go away.

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:57.140
We leave each other alone here.

00:04:57.660 --> 00:05:00.450
Ow! What are you doing?!

00:05:02.130 --> 00:05:04.720
Oh, this was just tangled up.

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:05.380
Y-You...

00:05:05.380 --> 00:05:07.150
I'm Taiki Kudou.

00:05:07.150 --> 00:05:07.920
And you?

00:05:08.360 --> 00:05:11.090
I-I'm P-Pinocchimon...

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:16.790
Pinocchimon, tell me 
about the Dust Zone.

00:05:17.140 --> 00:05:18.820
<i>What's with this guy?</i>

00:05:20.470 --> 00:05:24.600
This is where all the garbage 
of the Digital World goes.

00:05:24.600 --> 00:05:28.170
It's where loser Digimon like me end up.

00:05:28.480 --> 00:05:33.040
And it's a hellish Zone controlled by him.

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:33.990
Him?

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:37.080
Yuck!

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:41.030
Idiot! Don't waste precious DigiOil!

00:05:41.030 --> 00:05:42.280
Sorry.

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:44.420
Do you mean the Bagra Army?

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:47.530
I mean GrandLocomon.

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:48.900
GrandLocomon?

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:54.100
Yes. He's an unbelievably huge, 
strong, and out of control fiend.

00:05:54.970 --> 00:05:58.440
Once he starts moving, 
nobody can stop him.

00:05:58.440 --> 00:06:01.380
To get our DigiOil,

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:03.710
we have to collect mecha 
from among the garbage

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:06.260
and give it all to him.

00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:09.110
Even if we have to steal it from others.

00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:12.120
That's why you can't trust anybody...

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:15.910
if you want to stay alive.

00:06:16.670 --> 00:06:17.780
I...

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:21.110
I can't turn my back on this!

00:06:21.880 --> 00:06:24.550
There's Taiki's bad habit again...

00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:27.800
Taiki, we have to get the 
Xros Loader back first.

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:29.600
Xros Loader?!

00:06:30.300 --> 00:06:33.210
Yeah! If we can get 
the Xros Loader back,

00:06:33.210 --> 00:06:34.640
GrandLocomon won't be any—

00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:36.000
Let's go!

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:38.540
We'll get your Xros Loader back!

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:40.580
You'll help me?

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:41.650
Sure!

00:06:41.650 --> 00:06:44.790
I can't turn my back on someone 
who's in trouble, either!

00:06:44.790 --> 00:06:45.970
Really?

00:06:45.970 --> 00:06:48.420
Yep! I wouldn't lie!

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:51.410
<i>I'm sure I saw his nose get longer...</i>

00:06:51.410 --> 00:06:54.440
<i>I know! It must be because 
I'm so beautiful!</i>

00:06:55.110 --> 00:06:58.430
<i>Wait, it's the upper lip that stretches out 
when a boy sees a pretty girl...</i>

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:05.220
Hey! I got me a fancy mecha!

00:07:05.220 --> 00:07:07.490
I think that might be a Xros Loader.

00:07:08.180 --> 00:07:10.240
Huh? A Xros Loader?

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:13.630
A fancy mecha that 
GrandLocomon is looking for.

00:07:13.630 --> 00:07:14.450
Really?!

00:07:14.890 --> 00:07:18.560
I'll get lots of yummy DigiOil from this!

00:07:18.560 --> 00:07:19.850
All right!

00:07:19.850 --> 00:07:21.550
Hey!

00:07:21.550 --> 00:07:25.190
Team Xros Heart has you guys surrounded!

00:07:29.040 --> 00:07:31.030
H-How did you find this place?!

00:07:31.030 --> 00:07:33.510
We don't want to fight needlessly.

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:35.270
Give me back my Xros Loader.

00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:36.340
No way!

00:07:36.340 --> 00:07:40.140
We're gonna get DigiOil from 
GrandLocomon with this!

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:43.150
You guys just don't get it.

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:47.250
We're telling you that we're 
gonna defeat GrandLocomon!

00:07:49.160 --> 00:07:52.550
So you don't have to 
collect scrap anymore.

00:07:52.550 --> 00:07:54.420
Y-You mean it?

00:07:55.650 --> 00:08:00.520
You're really going to 
end GrandLocomon's reign?

00:08:00.520 --> 00:08:01.490
Then...

00:08:01.490 --> 00:08:03.610
I can't believe that!

00:08:08.560 --> 00:08:09.600
Pinocchimon!

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:11.310
You're alive?!

00:08:11.310 --> 00:08:12.770
That's right, I'm alive.

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:15.510
I've been...

00:08:15.740 --> 00:08:19.840
living alone in that collapsed 
pile of rubbish...

00:08:20.480 --> 00:08:21.880
all this time.

00:08:21.880 --> 00:08:23.570
We were so worried!

00:08:23.570 --> 00:08:25.150
We've been looking for you!

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:26.280
I'm so glad!

00:08:26.280 --> 00:08:27.950
Hand it over!

00:08:27.950 --> 00:08:29.430
As long as I have this,

00:08:29.430 --> 00:08:32.860
GrandLocomon will let 
me leave this Zone!

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:33.860
So long!

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:36.750
What?

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:40.730
Taiki! I'll be taking the Xros Loader!

00:08:41.170 --> 00:08:42.860
Pinocchimon!

00:08:42.860 --> 00:08:44.140
That creep!

00:08:45.100 --> 00:08:46.750
Bullet Hammer!

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:51.940
Now I can finally get out of here!

00:08:51.940 --> 00:08:53.760
Pinocchimon!

00:08:56.370 --> 00:08:58.940
We were so close...

00:08:58.940 --> 00:09:00.250
To what?

00:09:02.570 --> 00:09:04.450
When did you get here?

00:09:05.550 --> 00:09:07.430
I've got some business with you.

00:09:07.830 --> 00:09:10.470
The boy with the blue Xros Loader...

00:09:10.470 --> 00:09:12.300
Kiriha Aonuma.

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:15.810
So, what is your business with me?

00:09:15.810 --> 00:09:17.790
It's simple.

00:09:17.790 --> 00:09:21.330
Will you team up with me until 
I defeat the Bagra Army?

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:24.440
Oh? That is a bold question.

00:09:24.440 --> 00:09:27.050
I will use any means necessary to win.

00:09:27.050 --> 00:09:30.040
We're alike in that way, aren't we?

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:32.700
I'm happy to hear you say that.

00:09:33.990 --> 00:09:35.250
However...

00:09:36.350 --> 00:09:39.310
I'm sure that was not your 
only reason for coming here.

00:09:39.910 --> 00:09:42.960
What you seek is inside here.

00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:45.810
If you intend to team up with me,

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:48.680
I will give Nene, 
inside this orb, to you.

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:53.670
No need to hesitate.

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:07.270
The birth of the Darkness 
Loader has begun.

00:10:08.050 --> 00:10:11.060
As I'd expect of the boy 
Nene had her eye on...

00:10:11.990 --> 00:10:17.930
Now I have no reason to hide 
in this Zone any longer.

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:22.230
The monsters born in the 
Digital realm: Digimon.

00:10:22.230 --> 00:10:24.750
They may be made up of data,

00:10:24.750 --> 00:10:29.610
but they're our precious friends 
who cry, laugh, and fight for us.

00:10:29.610 --> 00:10:31.680
Join us in our world of adventure

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:35.250
as we gather lots more teammates!

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:36.310
DigiXros!

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:01.760
Are you okay?

00:12:03.830 --> 00:12:08.790
You are strange, worrying 
about us more than yourself.

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:09.620
Am I?

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:13.340
Anyway, that jerk, Pinocchimon!

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:17.630
Shoutmon!

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:18.720
Thank you...

00:12:22.550 --> 00:12:23.870
Oh?

00:12:23.870 --> 00:12:27.090
You really found a Xros Loader?

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:32.570
You'll let me leave this Zone 
now, right, GrandLocomon?

00:12:32.570 --> 00:12:34.160
First...

00:12:34.160 --> 00:12:36.710
I will check to make sure it's real.

00:12:37.280 --> 00:12:38.590
What is it?

00:12:38.590 --> 00:12:39.840
It is real!

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:42.960
Well done, Pinocchimon.

00:12:42.960 --> 00:12:45.740
Then you'll let me leave 
this Zone like you promised?

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:49.610
Yes. The Xros Loader has that power.

00:12:51.300 --> 00:12:52.420
However...

00:12:53.760 --> 00:12:57.240
The only one who will 
leave this Zone is me!

00:13:02.040 --> 00:13:04.960
You're stuck in this trash 
heap of a Zone forever!

00:13:04.960 --> 00:13:07.820
I have to spend the 
rest of my life here?

00:13:10.940 --> 00:13:12.270
You expect me to give up?!

00:13:20.020 --> 00:13:21.660
What's that noise?

00:13:21.660 --> 00:13:24.420
GrandLocomon is on the move.

00:13:24.420 --> 00:13:25.450
GrandLocomon?

00:13:25.860 --> 00:13:28.840
Once he starts to move, 
this Zone is done for!

00:13:31.900 --> 00:13:33.750
We have to do something,

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:36.320
or the whole Zone will be destroyed!

00:13:36.320 --> 00:13:39.060
What do we do next, General?

00:13:39.060 --> 00:13:43.040
Please, take us to GrandLocomon.

00:13:49.370 --> 00:13:51.830
Hagurumon, are the 
preparations complete?

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:53.810
They are.

00:13:55.470 --> 00:13:56.550
Just watch.

00:13:56.950 --> 00:13:59.450
The door out of the 
Zone is about to open.

00:14:00.070 --> 00:14:03.360
When my speed reaches the maximum,

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:06.020
I can escape the Dust Zone...

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:10.060
this rancid trash heap of a Zone!

00:14:11.380 --> 00:14:13.260
That town is in my way!

00:14:20.760 --> 00:14:23.340
Oh, no! It's GrandLocomon!

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:26.250
There won't be anything left 
once he's passed through!

00:14:26.250 --> 00:14:28.230
He must be really powerful...

00:14:28.230 --> 00:14:28.850
That light...

00:14:29.370 --> 00:14:31.450
Is that the light of a Zone exit?

00:14:31.450 --> 00:14:35.950
Is he trying to use the Xros 
Loader to escape this Zone?

00:14:35.950 --> 00:14:37.420
What?!

00:14:37.930 --> 00:14:40.710
If a Digimon like that 
goes to another Zone...

00:14:41.200 --> 00:14:43.030
Hurry! We have to catch up!

00:14:48.560 --> 00:14:51.760
The exit is almost open!

00:14:52.180 --> 00:14:54.870
I won't let you have your way!

00:14:55.210 --> 00:14:58.030
How dare you deceive me?!

00:14:59.990 --> 00:15:01.910
You're supposed to be dead.

00:15:17.740 --> 00:15:19.680
I won't give up!

00:15:20.900 --> 00:15:22.610
Pinocchimon!

00:15:22.610 --> 00:15:25.650
Faster! We need to go faster!

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:28.290
This is the best I can do 
with this beat-up chassis!

00:15:31.090 --> 00:15:32.580
Pinocchimon!

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:34.880
Pinocchimon!

00:15:42.720 --> 00:15:45.810
At times like these, just leave 
everything to the great Zenjirou.

00:15:45.810 --> 00:15:46.870
And me!

00:15:46.870 --> 00:15:47.490
That's huge!

00:15:48.580 --> 00:15:49.840
You can do it!

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:07.170
Are you okay?

00:16:07.170 --> 00:16:08.840
Pinocchimon!

00:16:10.120 --> 00:16:11.410
Pinocchimon!

00:16:11.410 --> 00:16:13.410
We came to save you.

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:14.090
You all...

00:16:14.400 --> 00:16:17.360
came to help... me?

00:16:24.190 --> 00:16:26.230
The Zone exit is opening!

00:16:27.030 --> 00:16:29.730
We're out of time! We have to stop him!

00:16:30.180 --> 00:16:32.000
Leave it to us!

00:16:36.240 --> 00:16:37.140
What?!

00:16:38.820 --> 00:16:42.880
We won't let you leave this Zone!

00:16:43.910 --> 00:16:45.250
Our speed...

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:47.980
We won't be able to exit the Zone!

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:50.580
You guys...

00:16:50.580 --> 00:16:54.290
You said nobody in this 
Zone could be trusted.

00:16:54.980 --> 00:16:56.090
Don't you think

00:16:56.090 --> 00:16:58.960
that was just because you 
didn't trust your friends?

00:16:59.500 --> 00:17:02.100
You should rely on your 
friends a little more.

00:17:02.990 --> 00:17:06.400
Trust in them when you're feeling down.

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:08.780
Trust my friends?

00:17:10.700 --> 00:17:13.120
I could never do that!

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:19.020
Your nose gets longer when 
you tell a lie, you know.

00:17:23.320 --> 00:17:26.320
Are you the one impeding our escape?!

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:30.860
Leave this to me!

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:37.110
Not gonna work!

00:17:39.300 --> 00:17:40.620
Pinocchimon!

00:17:44.600 --> 00:17:47.110
Bullet Hammer!

00:17:50.950 --> 00:17:52.350
What is this?!

00:17:52.970 --> 00:17:54.420
Serves you right!

00:17:57.150 --> 00:17:59.700
Taiki! I trust you!

00:18:04.300 --> 00:18:05.630
You will pay!

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:09.630
Time to DigiXros!

00:18:12.060 --> 00:18:13.270
Shoutmon!

00:18:13.270 --> 00:18:15.210
Okay!

00:18:15.210 --> 00:18:16.510
Ballistamon!

00:18:17.840 --> 00:18:19.140
Dorulumon!

00:18:20.550 --> 00:18:21.550
Starmons!

00:18:21.550 --> 00:18:23.750
Yes!

00:18:23.750 --> 00:18:25.580
DigiXros!

00:18:25.580 --> 00:18:27.190
DigiXros!

00:18:28.850 --> 00:18:32.070
Shoutmon X4!

00:18:33.580 --> 00:18:36.360
J-Just what are you?!

00:18:37.390 --> 00:18:39.600
We are Xros Heart.

00:18:40.350 --> 00:18:42.190
And we won't let you get away

00:18:42.190 --> 00:18:44.100
with riding roughshod over the Dust Zone!

00:18:44.970 --> 00:18:50.210
I, Shoutmon X4, will cut you down!

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:51.940
Don't make me laugh!

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:54.460
Destroyed Crash!

00:19:01.710 --> 00:19:03.190
That won't work.

00:19:11.230 --> 00:19:14.070
I'll make you regret the evil you've done!

00:19:15.690 --> 00:19:16.650
What?!

00:19:24.510 --> 00:19:25.870
He did it...

00:19:25.870 --> 00:19:29.340
He actually beat GrandLocomon!

00:19:40.930 --> 00:19:42.530
Thank goodness!

00:19:42.530 --> 00:19:44.560
Looks like this case is closed!

00:19:44.560 --> 00:19:45.460
Yeah!

00:19:45.460 --> 00:19:47.850
Pinocchimon looks really happy, too.

00:19:48.730 --> 00:19:50.770
I-I am not!

00:19:53.100 --> 00:19:55.350
Your nose is growing!

00:19:56.810 --> 00:20:00.260
Now Pinocchimon won't 
have to leave this Zone.

00:20:13.490 --> 00:20:15.190
What just happened?!

00:20:18.330 --> 00:20:19.970
Y-You're...

00:20:22.090 --> 00:20:23.610
DarkKnightmon!

00:20:25.360 --> 00:20:26.670
We meet again.

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:32.790
I wanted you to see my new fighting force.

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:36.110
That's...

00:20:36.450 --> 00:20:37.690
Kiriha?

00:20:37.690 --> 00:20:40.020
Yes, Kiriha Aonuma.

00:20:41.090 --> 00:20:43.030
The blue Xros Loader...

00:20:43.030 --> 00:20:47.290
That is my new fighting force.

00:20:47.830 --> 00:20:48.630
No way!

00:20:53.050 --> 00:20:54.620
<b>To Be Continued</b>

