00:21:09.010 --> 00:21:14.490
<b>Horn Buster</b>

00:21:10.900 --> 00:21:14.490
A rhinoceros beetle! 
Does it eat watermelons?

00:21:16.050 --> 00:21:18.560
Kiriha is working for DarkKnightmon now!

00:21:18.560 --> 00:21:21.150
Have you betrayed your 
own beliefs, Kiriha?

00:21:21.150 --> 00:21:22.760
And Lilithmon has shown up again!

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:25.930
This is all a trap set by DarkKnightmon!

00:21:26.010 --> 00:21:27.430
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:29.320
<b>The Decisive Battle!</b>

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:29.320
<b>DarkKnightmon VS Xros Heart!</b>

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:29.370
You can't turn your back 
on the next one, either!
